SEG-27: the segment's icon is marked when the icon set mirrors its name in right-to-left (src/primitives/glyph-mirror.ts);
`iconGlyph()` draws the mark, in the glyph's own box. The check is not named to the controller: it is never mirrored
(SEG-16).

SKL-12, SKL-24: every placeholder in step. Placeholders that were there when the skeleton was shown began together;
one that was added since, or parsed in a later piece of the page, began when it arrived, and is given the others'
beginning. Nothing is restarted.

SNK-16, SNK-23, SNK-25, measured with the text collapsed:
- the action goes onto its own row when the title and the message together would need more than two lines beside
  the controls, or the action's label would not fit (measured with the action inline);
- the expand button is drawn when the title or the message is cut at its line limit (measured as it is drawn);
- expanded, the text is a focus stop when it scrolls inside the bar (measured as it is drawn).

